Working blog website built through Angular for Frontend and Node.js using AWS for backend.

start app locally:

1. check if you are in the right directory : cd "C:\Users\Nikola\Desktop\Devleet Blog\devleet_blog-1\devleet-blog"
2. start the app : ng serve --open

REST API endpoint: https://gocqije9g1.execute-api.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/dev
